event: message
data: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"tools":[{"name":"ailang-check","description":"Type-check and Z3-verify an episode-worktree AILANG file. Returns structured {ok, passed, error_count, errors:[{code,message,file}]} (line/column in message), or {ok:false,status,refused}. Path: non-empty, relative, no `..` segments or leading `-`; policy confines symlinks and protected paths. Unknown keys refuse. Costs one Ailang.Check; commits one entry with World plan/effect refs.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"path":{"description":"Path to the .ail file, relative to the worktree root","type":"string"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"},"outputSchema":{"properties":{"error_count":{"type":"integer"},"errors":{"items":{"properties":{"code":{"type":"string"},"file":{"type":"string"},"message":{"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"ok":{"type":"boolean"},"passed":{"type":"boolean"},"refused":{"description":"Why the call was refused (plan, policy or handler)","type":"string"},"status":{"description":"The effect's status when no report was produced","type":"string"},"world":{"description":"World's provenance: the plan ref and the effect record refs","type":"object"}},"required":["world"],"type":"object"}},{"name":"ailang-cli","description":"Run an allowlisted AILANG op: agent_prompt, ai_check, axioms, builtins_list, builtins_show, check, devtools_prompt, docs_search, examples_list, examples_search, examples_show, examples_tags, fmt, iface, pkg_docs, policy_check, prompt, test, tree, version. Arguments: path for check/ai_check/fmt/tree/policy_check; module for iface/pkg_docs/examples_show/builtins_show; query for searches; optional path/package for test. Op-admitted flags only; booleans take an empty string. Never writes: fmt write refuses; save formatted stdout with ailang-write. Paths/packages obey worktree confinement. Unknown keys refuse. Returns CLI argv/exit/stdout/stderr or refusal plus World plan/effect refs; costs one Ailang.CLI and commits one entry.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"flags":{"additionalProperties":{"type":"string"},"description":"Admitted flags by name; boolean flags take \"\" (e.g. {\"json\": \"\"})","type":"object"},"module":{"description":"Module path or name (iface: \"std/fs\"; examples_show/builtins_show: a name)","type":"string"},"op":{"description":"The operation, e.g. \"check\", \"iface\", \"docs_search\", \"test\"","type":"string"},"package":{"description":"Package directory for test (in-worktree)","type":"string"},"path":{"description":"In-worktree file path (check, ai_check, fmt, tree, policy_check, test)","type":"string"},"query":{"description":"Search text (docs_search, examples_search)","type":"string"}},"required":["op"],"type":"object"},"outputSchema":{"properties":{"argv":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"exit_code":{"type":"integer"},"ok":{"type":"boolean"},"refused":{"description":"Why the call was refused (plan, policy or handler)","type":"string"},"stderr":{"type":"string"},"stdout":{"type":"string"},"world":{"description":"World's provenance: the plan ref and the effect record refs","type":"object"}},"required":["world"],"type":"object"}},{"name":"ailang-edit","description":"Replace old_text with new_text in an episode-worktree file; old_text must occur exactly once (include enough context). Path: non-empty, relative, no `..` segments or leading `-`; policy confines symlinks and protected paths. Unknown keys refuse. Returns ok or refusal plus World plan/effect refs; costs one Workspace.Write and commits one entry.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"new_text":{"description":"Replacement text","type":"string"},"old_text":{"description":"Exact text to replace (must occur exactly once)","type":"string"},"path":{"description":"File path, relative to the worktree root","type":"string"}},"required":["path","old_text","new_text"],"type":"object"},"outputSchema":{"properties":{"ok":{"type":"boolean"},"refused":{"description":"Why the call was refused (plan, policy or handler)","type":"string"},"world":{"description":"World's provenance: the plan ref and the effect record refs","type":"object"}},"required":["world"],"type":"object"}},{"name":"ailang-read","description":"Read an episode-worktree file. Path: non-empty, relative, no `..` segments or leading `-`; policy confines symlinks and protected paths. Unknown keys refuse. Returns content or refusal plus World plan/effect refs; costs one Workspace.Read and commits one entry.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"path":{"description":"File path, relative to the worktree root","type":"string"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"},"outputSchema":{"properties":{"content":{"type":"string"},"ok":{"type":"boolean"},"refused":{"description":"Why the call was refused (plan, policy or handler)","type":"string"},"world":{"description":"World's provenance: the plan ref and the effect record refs","type":"object"}},"required":["world"],"type":"object"}},{"name":"ailang-run","description":"Run an episode-worktree AILANG program under policy (8 s timeout). caps is exact, default IO/FS; never Env with Net. Extra caps require operator enablement; Env/Net also require Ailang.RunEnv/Ailang.RunNet grants, otherwise Ailang.Run. Net reaches only operator-allowed loopback host:port pairs; other targets/redirects refuse. args_json supplies entrypoint JSON; stdin is text (absent=empty); argv follows inner `--` (schema limits). Declared effects must fit policy; unrequested FS has budget 0 and fails at use. Denied programs never execute: inspect decision.missing_from_policy, narrow effects or request authorized caps. An inner refusal may exit 0: inspect stdout/stderr. Inner effects use policy, not individual broker calls. Use a non-empty relative path without `..` segments or leading `-`; policy confines symlinks/protected paths. Unknown keys refuse. Returns admission, exit/limit, stdout/stderr, policy and World plan/effect refs; costs one call of its effect and commits one entry.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"args_json":{"description":"JSON arguments for the entrypoint (passed as --args-json)","type":"string"},"argv":{"description":"Program arguments (getArgs), passed after an inner `--`; at most 32, each at most 1024 bytes, no NUL","items":{"type":"string"},"maxItems":32,"type":"array"},"caps":{"description":"The run's exact capability set (default IO, FS); never Env with Net","items":{"enum":["Declassify","Env","FS","IO","Net"],"type":"string"},"minItems":1,"type":"array","uniqueItems":true},"path":{"description":"Path to the .ail file, relative to the worktree root","type":"string"},"stdin":{"description":"The program's whole standard input, at most 65536 UTF-8 bytes (absent = empty)","type":"string"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"},"outputSchema":{"properties":{"admitted":{"type":"boolean"},"decision":{},"exit_code":{"type":"integer"},"limit":{},"ok":{"type":"boolean"},"policy":{"description":"The policy variant that ran: {digest, security_mode, caps, net_allow}","type":"object"},"refused":{"description":"Why the call was refused (plan, policy or handler)","type":"string"},"stderr":{"type":"string"},"stdout":{"type":"string"},"world":{"description":"World's provenance: the plan ref and the effect record refs","type":"object"}},"required":["world"],"type":"object"}},{"name":"ailang-write","description":"Create/overwrite an episode-worktree file with complete content. Path: non-empty, relative, no `..` segments or leading `-`; policy confines symlinks and protected paths. Unknown keys refuse. Returns ok or refusal plus World plan/effect refs; costs one Workspace.Write and commits one entry.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"content":{"description":"The complete new file content","type":"string"},"path":{"description":"File path, relative to the worktree root","type":"string"}},"required":["path","content"],"type":"object"},"outputSchema":{"properties":{"ok":{"type":"boolean"},"refused":{"description":"Why the call was refused (plan, policy or handler)","type":"string"},"world":{"description":"World's provenance: the plan ref and the effect record refs","type":"object"}},"required":["world"],"type":"object"}},{"name":"builtins-search","description":"Search the tool binary's real builtin inventory; query is a case-insensitive name/module/effect substring (max 10 matches), module filters; omit both for all. Returns {count,matches:[{name,module,effect}]}; degraded: no signatures/descriptions returned or searched. Use ailang-cli builtins_show or examples-search for usage. Truncated/invalid inventory refuses, never empty success. Unknown keys refuse. Costs one Ailang.Discover; commits one entry with World plan/effect refs.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"module":{"description":"Module filter, e.g. std/fs","type":"string"},"query":{"description":"Substring to look for","type":"string"}},"required":[],"type":"object"},"outputSchema":{"properties":{"count":{"type":"integer"},"matches":{"items":{"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"ok":{"type":"boolean"},"refused":{"description":"Why the call was refused (plan, policy or handler)","type":"string"},"status":{"description":"The effect's status when no inventory was produced","type":"string"},"world":{"description":"World's provenance: the plan ref and the effect record refs","type":"object"}},"required":["world"],"type":"object"}},{"name":"examples-search","description":"Search the configured examples corpus for query; read hits with ailang-cli examples_show. No flags or limit argument. Use before guessing syntax. Returns CLI stdout/stderr or refusal if no corpus is configured. Unknown keys refuse. Costs one Ailang.Discover; commits one entry with World plan/effect refs.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"query":{"description":"Text to search the examples for","type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"type":"object"},"outputSchema":{"properties":{"ok":{"type":"boolean"},"refused":{"description":"Why the call was refused (plan, policy or handler)","type":"string"},"stdout":{"type":"string"},"world":{"description":"World's provenance: the plan ref and the effect record refs","type":"object"}},"required":["world"],"type":"object"}}]}}

